// # Modern Graph Database & OpenCypher Engine Facade
//
// Logline: Standard library facade re-exporting property graph storage, OpenCypher parsing, query planning, and graph algorithms.
//
// Setup: Master entry point unifying all 50 graph database, query optimization, traversal, and pattern matching submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import OpenCypher parsing, logical/physical planning, and cost estimator submodules.
//   2. Import property graph storage, CSR indexing, transaction management, and pattern engines.
//   3. Provide high-level initialization facades and default engine configurations.

